&lt;p&gt;The Bid Coordinator is the organizational backbone of the bid team. Working alongside Bid Managers and Bid Specialists, this role makes sure every bid runs to a rigorous, well-managed process, so that deadlines are met, contributors know what is expected of them, and nothing falls through the cracks. This is a process and project coordination role rather than a content or strategy role. The ideal candidate is highly organized, detail-oriented, and proactive: someone who enjoys building order out of complexity, keeps many moving parts on track at once, and is comfortable following up with colleagues across the business to keep work moving. It is a strong entry point for someone looking to grow a career in bid management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bid Planning and Scheduling Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Bid Managers in building bid plans that work backward from the submission date, including milestones, review gates, internal deadlines, and buffer time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and maintain bid trackers, schedules, and responsibility matrices (e.g., RACI) for each pursuit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep plans up to date as timelines shift, and flag schedule risks to the Bid Manager early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tracking, Follow-Up, and&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track every deliverable, owner, and deadline across the bid team and contributing functions (Legal, Finance, Operations, Technical, Sales).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send clear, timely reminders and follow up on outstanding inputs so contributions arrive on time and complete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate missed or at-risk deadlines to the Bid Manager promptly, with a clear summary of impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain action and decision logs from bid meetings and make sure actions are closed out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tender Documentation and Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Review tender documents on release and produce compliance matrices and requirement checklists.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Track customer clarification questions, responses, and addenda, and make sure&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-2&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;changes are communicated to the team and reflected in the plan.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-2&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;Run final compliance checks on formatting, page limits, mandatory forms, signatures, certifications, and attachments before submission.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-2&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;Manage submission logistics on customer portals, including registration, uploads, and confirmation receipts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meeting and Review Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and organize kickoff meetings, status meetings, and review sessions (e.g., color team reviews).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare agendas, circulate materials in advance, capture notes, and distribute actions afterward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate reviewer availability and consolidate review feedback for the Bid Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Document and Content Management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and manage bid folders, version control, and document naming conventions so the team always works from the latest version.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the assembly, formatting, and production of final bid documents, working with designers or writers where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the bid content library, templates, case studies, CVs, certifications, and standard company information, keeping them current and easy to find.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Tender and Pipeline Administration&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the pre-tender and gate process by preparing gate review materials, tracking approvals, and recording bid/no-bid decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor tender portals and opportunity sources and log new opportunities in the pipeline tracker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep pipeline and bid reporting accurate, including status, key dates, and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement and Lessons Learned&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help embed consistent bid processes, templates, and checklists across all pursuits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize post-submission and win/loss debriefs, record lessons learned, and track improvement actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest practical improvements to tools and ways of working based on what is and isn&#39;t working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-2&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;2–4 years of experience in a coordination, project support, bid/proposal support,&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-3&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-2&quot;&gt;or administrative role in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-3&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-2&quot;&gt;Strong organizational and time management skills, with a proven ability to manage multiple deadlines and priorities at once.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-3&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a methodical approach to tracking and checking work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-3&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-2&quot;&gt;Confident, professional communicator who is comfortable following up with colleagues at all levels, including senior stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-3&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-2&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Office or Google Workspace (especially Excel/Sheets and Word/Docs) and comfort with project tracking tools.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-3&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-2&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting public sector or formal procurement tenders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with project management tools (e.g., Smartsheet, Asana, Monday, Jira) and e-procurement portals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APMP Foundation certification or project coordination training (e.g., CAPM, PRINCE2 Foundation), or interest in pursuing one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic document formatting or design skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended health and dental coverage options, along with life insurance and disability benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family building benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a Lyft funded Health Care Savings Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RRSP plan with company match to help save for your future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to provincial observed holidays, salaried team members are covered under Lyft&#39;s flexible paid time off policy. The policy allows team members to take off as much time as they need (with manager approval). Hourly team members get 15 days paid time off, with an additional day for each year of service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lyft is proud to support new parents with 18 weeks of paid time off, designed as a top-up plan to complement provincial programs. Biological, adoptive, and foster parents are all eligible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized commuter benefits and Lyft ride credits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lyft is committed to creating an inclusive workforce that fosters belonging. Lyft believes that every person has a right to equal employment opportunities without discrimination because of race, ancestry, place of origin, colour, ethnic origin, citizenship, creed, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital status, family status, disability, pardoned record of offences, or any other basis protected by applicable law or by Company policy. Lyft also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&amp;nbsp; Accommodation for persons with disabilities will be provided upon request in accordance with applicable law during the application and hiring process. Please contact your recruiter if you wish to make such a request.&lt;/p&gt;
