&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Lyft, our purpose is to serve and connect. We aim to achieve this by cultivating a work environment where all team members belong and have the opportunity to thrive.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for influencing product roadmaps through analytics and financial and&amp;nbsp;business modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop hypotheses and analytical frameworks for understanding pricing dynamics and market outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze collected data and extract information relevant to problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product leads to build efficient tools, systems, and processes to manage pricing and driver earning at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and test quantitative models, support software, and analytical tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Education and Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Operations Research, Analytics, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of experience in job offered, analytics, or related occupation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with quantitative analysis, predictive modeling, and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with programming languages, analytical software, and database applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with business analytics and authoring data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with optimization and programming, including C++, R, Python, and algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great medical, dental, and vision insurance options with additional programs available when enrolled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family building benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Child care and pet benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan to help save for your future&lt;/li&gt;
