&lt;li&gt;Available during &lt;strong&gt;Summer 2027&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for an internship in &lt;strong&gt;Toronto&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of CS fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SQL and data modeling fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in solving large scale data problems in a real world scenario&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for community, sustainability, and/or transportation&lt;/li&gt;
