&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write production modeling code; collaborate with software engineers to implement algorithms in production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
