&lt;li&gt;Build relationships across engineering teams to share learnings, align on standards, and identify collaboration opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business goals into clear engineering plans, helping the team understand the &quot;why&quot; behind their work and stay motivated by impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address underperformance early, while consistently recognizing individual strengths and contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring by partnering with recruiting, conducting interviews, and helping define and uphold the team&#39;s engineering bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
