&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop features for embedded systems across our Micromobility product line(vehicles, docks, internal tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional teams to prototype, develop, and take to production, our next generation of world-class mobility products.&lt;/li&gt;
