&lt;li&gt;5+ Years developing in C/C++ for embedded systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with using Python for scripting and automated-test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using an embedded real-time OS (FreeRTOS, ThreadX, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
