&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;63&quot;&gt;Lyft is building the safety capability for autonomous mobility. As Program Manager, AV Safety Policy &amp;amp; Programs, you&#39;ll own key parts of Lyft&#39;s AV Safety Management System (SMS) across all four pillars: Safety Policy, Safety Risk Management, Safety Assurance, and Safety Promotion. You&#39;ll also make sure the processes, documentation, and cross-functional machinery behind them work in practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;461&quot;&gt;This is a high-ownership role that sits at the intersection of safety policy, program design, and cross-functional process support. You&#39;ll author policy, run risk and review cadences, turn safety data into decisions, and keep the Safety Review Board (SRB) running. You&#39;ll work closely with AV partners, and you can speak credibly about AV safety with technical counterparts, senior leaders, and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-You&#39;ll-Do&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;894&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Safety Policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Own Lyft&#39;s AV safety policy framework, safety procedures, and partner-facing governance documentation, including version control and periodic review cycles. Maintain governance charters, committee operating rhythms, and escalation protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1154&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Safety Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Run hazard identification and risk assessment for AV operations and new launches. Maintain the operational risk register and track mitigations to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Safety Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Track safety performance indicators and trends, and surface emerging risks. Participate in incident and near-miss investigations and own corrective action (CAPA) tracking, so findings feed back into policy, operations, and partner work plans. Coordinate evidence and remediation for audits and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Safety Promotion:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive safety communications, lessons-learned documentation, and training readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1772&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Safety Review Board:&lt;/strong&gt; Run the SRB cadence, including agendas, materials, decision records, and follow-through on action items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1901&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the standards and assessment frameworks Lyft uses with AV partners, and support partners&#39; safety assurance and risk management activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Program Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive AV safety programs with safety leaders, including partners across EHS, Operations, Engineering, Legal, and others from inception through go-live. This includes safety readiness for new market launches and partner integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-We&#39;re-Looking-For&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2332&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2368&quot;&gt;4+ years supporting or managing safety management programs in a safety-critical transportation industry (AV, aviation, rail, automotive, trucking, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2533&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of SMS principles and how they apply to AV operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2608&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with risk assessment, incident follow-up, and corrective action tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2704&quot;&gt;Strong technical writing, including policy, procedures, and partner- or regulator-facing materials&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2807&quot;&gt;Comfort with safety data, including tracking indicators, spotting trends, and presenting findings to technical and senior audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2942&quot;&gt;Proven ability to run multi-stakeholder programs without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3019&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in safety, engineering, policy, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;Nice-to-Have&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3127&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3143&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AV safety frameworks (e.g., AVSC best practices) and US AV reporting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3245&quot;&gt;Experience supporting robotaxi, ridehail, or fleet operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3310&quot;&gt;Experience operating in a matrixed, partner-dependent environment where safety policy must be implemented through influence rather than direct control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3464&quot;&gt;Exposure to multi-market or international safety operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great medical, dental, and vision insurance options with additional programs available when enrolled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family building benefits&lt;/li&gt;
