&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Trust and Safety is at the core of Lyft’s business. Our work ensures that our drivers and riders are part of a trusted and trusting community. Lyft’s global expansion and the development of a hybrid platform (with autonomous vehicles driving side by side to drivers) are a unique opportunity to help us redefine how we deliver in our promise of safety. This is a highly cross functional role that will partner with our Growth organization to rethink how we support these partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
