&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Senior Software Engineer on the Foundational Infrastructure &amp;amp; Networking team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the core routing, service mesh, and control planes that power hundreds of microservices processing millions of rides daily. This is an IC role with massive engineering leverage: your technical architecture, systems design, and performance optimizations will directly amplify the velocity of every software engineer across Lyft while ensuring platform resiliency at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Scale Core Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and optimize our service mesh, ingress/egress infrastructure, and edge routing capabilities using Envoy Proxy and custom control planes on AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optimize High-Throughput Control Planes:&lt;/strong&gt; Enhance load-balancing algorithms, service discovery, and dynamic scaling mechanisms across high-concurrency data and control planes running on Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Systems Reliability &amp;amp; Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Operationalize deep telemetry, metrics, and distributed tracing across our networking stack to drastically reduce mean-time-to-detect (MTTD) and resolution (MTTR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-on Production Debugging:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex technical investigations into cross-stack incidents spanning kernel parameters, cloud VPC network layers, DNS, and distributed microservice protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate engineering rigor through RFC reviews, technical vision, incident response post-mortems, and mentoring engineers across the broader Infrastructure org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;6+ Years of Production Systems Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record building and operating massive-scale cloud infrastructure and networking platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Expertise in Cloud Networking &amp;amp; Protocols:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of Linux networking, TCP/IP, DNS, gRPC, HTTP/2, load balancing, and AWS networking architecture (VPCs, NLBs, subnets, transit gateways).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Service Mesh &amp;amp; Proxy Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience building or operating large-scale proxy and mesh technologies (e.g., Envoy, Istio, Cilium, Nginx).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Container Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience managing production Kubernetes clusters running on public cloud providers (AWS/GCP) using Infrastructure-as-Code tools (Terraform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Distributed Systems Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated skill in isolating and debugging complex, multi-layered system failures under high throughput conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended health and dental coverage options, along with life insurance and disability benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family building benefits&lt;/li&gt;
