&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Extended health and dental coverage options, along with life insurance and disability benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
