&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Lyft, our purpose is to serve and connect. We aim to achieve this by cultivating a work environment where all team members belong and have the opportunity to thrive.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own features end-to-end from product specs through deployment and&amp;nbsp;maintenance, ensuring high quality at every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive frontend architecture for modern web applications using React, TypeScript, and/or Next.js. Collaborate cross-functionally to integrate emerging technologies into our evolving infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the roadmap by contributing technical perspective on architecture decisions and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write maintainable code with comprehensive testing, clear documentation, and thoughtful design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor through code reviews that prioritize both quality and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your team through pairing, healthy technical debates, and a culture of mutual growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with stakeholders to gather requirements, communicate progress, and respond to technical questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Education and Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year of experience in job offered, software development, or related occupation.&lt;/li&gt;
